        "TileImage": "$($repository 0a6c5432-1aa3-41e3-b89b-01e54efb83d1).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, Agent [REDACTED].\rI&apos;m afraid this is not the typical kind of contract you may be used to. Our client has given us intel on an underground terrorist group, still nameless but well known in the underworld of agents, thugs, criminals and the like. Eliminate the five targets, leave no survivors. It is reported that these individuals are vile and ruthless criminals with no care for consequence. Use that arrogance against them. I will leave you to prepare.\rGood luck, Agent [REDACTED].",
